[h1]Flavorium Universalis - UI Fixes v0.4.0: EU5 1.4[/h1]

[i]Compatible with EU5 1.4.* | Requires: Flavorium Universalis[/i]

[hr][/hr]

Updated for EU5 1.4. The version jumps to 0.4 to match the game version. Not compatible with 1.3.

[h2]Fixes[/h2]

[list]
[*] [b]The game crashed when choosing a target for an interaction.[/b] This submod replaces the target picker to add the cabinet action description toggle, and its copy was the 1.3 picker. 1.4 changed where the picker's list lives, so the old copy had no list and the game crashed when it opened. The picker is rebuilt on the 1.4 version with the toggle added back, and the toggle now only appears on the cabinet action picker.
[*] The cabinet action list's skill badges match 1.4 and are hidden for ministers whose stats are not shown.
[*] The age event advance list's scrollbar uses a setting 1.4 accepts.
[/list]
